# Power BI Desktop's local files inside a PBIP project: per-user settings and the imported
# data cache (can be hundreds of MB). The model (TMDL) and report definitions are committed.
**/.pbi/localSettings.json
**/.pbi/cache.abf
# Exported .pbix files embed the data; the PBIP project is the source of truth.
*.pbix
# Local build notes, kept off GitHub.
BUILD_GUIDE.md
PowerBIPerformanceData*.json
